0011: module M6 instrumentation (ViSlamBackend entry log), active only with OKVIS_PORT_GRAPH_DUMP_DIR.
 New records in problem.bin (tags 128.., layouts in okvis_port/c/ok_vslam.h): one record at the ENTRY of every
 ViSlamBackend method the frontend / ThreadedSlam drives (addStates with the multiframe keypoints, addLandmark, addObservation,
 applyStrategy, optimiseRealtimeGraph, attemptLoopClosure, ...; tag | 0x100 = its results at exit) and one per MultiFrame::setLandmarkId.
 They are the INPUTS of the backend; the graph records (tag >= 32) that follow are what the C backend must regenerate.
 No computed value changes.

